[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 2341.829, "timestamp": "00:39:01", "text": "你以前是不是教英文之類的"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2344.71, "timestamp": "00:39:04", "text": "？你到底有沒有……呃，其實沒有？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2356.15, "timestamp": "00:39:16", "text": "我是語言專業的學生。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2371.51, "timestamp": "00:39:31", "text": "所以，嗯，兩到四年後，我就可以決定要去哪一家章魚燒店了。  哦，等等。沒關係。這就是結局。  這就是結局。哦好的。所以，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2376.71, "timestamp": "00:39:36", "text": "我們反其道而行。所以，我們反其道而行。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2379.91, "timestamp": "00:39:39", "text": "所以，它跟其他類型的"}, {"type": "chat", "time": 2388.652, "timestamp": "00:39:48", "author": "@KosmikZethar", "avatar": "https://yt4.ggpht.com/b_m56i87DkQCWoSLK8J6eGPlt0w4dJQYTlT9PaGPCOWZzEZaUiSe6Q-t3xsz9BESFJqhLP1oHg=s64-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj", "message": "Ohh!"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2398.23, "timestamp": "00:39:58", "text": "商店差不多。  它只是被拉得很長而已。就像我們看到的，"}]